        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "20e87244-7a4d-3d54-8f15-23d1f4e5a705",
                "word": "gedachtenis",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "51289f27-4449-438b-ad0e-99556acba2dd",
                        "entry_id": "20e87244-7a4d-3d54-8f15-23d1f4e5a705",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "gedachtenissen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "21e4c1d3-ce72-3623-a8cc-2b437a0ec7fa",
                        "entry_id": "20e87244-7a4d-3d54-8f15-23d1f4e5a705",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een dag waarop een heilige of een groep van heiligen in de Katholieke Kerk herdacht worden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f04e6fc4-9cb8-3f4e-ae6a-41f98ebd97bb",
                        "entry_id": "20e87244-7a4d-3d54-8f15-23d1f4e5a705",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het oproepen van iets in de gedachten om te voorkomen dat je het zou vergeten; vaak ook als eerbetoon"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af670142-de35-4dec-b3e1-7a30038987cb",
                                "sense_id": "f04e6fc4-9cb8-3f4e-ae6a-41f98ebd97bb",
                                "text": "Het dienstboek schrijft dan ook: “De taal van de kerk is traditioneel in die zin dat zij in gedachtenis roept wat is geschied. Dat is geen vrijbrief voor archaïsmen. Evenmin is de opdracht tot actualiseren een uitnodiging tot eendimensionaal taalgebruik. Altijd houdt liturgische taal een verwijzend karakter. Zij biedt ruimte om in ieders leven gehoord en beleefd te worden.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b39aeda-c8e5-411e-af78-1eb0ff98abf5",
                                "sense_id": "f04e6fc4-9cb8-3f4e-ae6a-41f98ebd97bb",
                                "text": "Bijna twintig jaar geleden is mijn broer, Koning Boudewijn, van ons heengegaan, en ik heb hem dan opgevolgd. Zijn gedachtenis wens ik nogmaals te eren. Hij verstond de kunst om staatsmanschap en het nakomen van zijn plicht te laten samengaan met ware goedheid, met grote eenvoud, en met zorg voor de zwakste in onze samenleving."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d159f9f-7442-4dbe-923f-b9390b611397",
                        "source_entry_id": "20e87244-7a4d-3d54-8f15-23d1f4e5a705",
                        "source_sense_id": "21e4c1d3-ce72-3623-a8cc-2b437a0ec7fa",
                        "source_sense_description": "het oproepen van iets in de gedachten om te voorkomen dat je het zou vergeten vaak ook als eerbetoon",
                        "target_lang_word": "memory",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "memory",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "280c86c0-dd62-32e0-89ad-d039c9f6f4fe",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9c9c0-c7fa-37d0-9793-d9f92a7c0954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ability of the brain to record information or impressions with the facility of recalling them later, usually at will."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f55a38ad-e634-4a3e-808e-978dfdd97ba3",
                                                "sense_id": "280c86c0-dd62-32e0-89ad-d039c9f6f4fe",
                                                "text": "Memory is a facility common to all animals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "005b271d-311b-38c9-b672-151bc69eb284",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9c9c0-c7fa-37d0-9793-d9f92a7c0954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A record of a thing or an event stored and available for later use by the organism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2668ad4-334a-4dd0-a5a1-4d873ab545eb",
                                                "sense_id": "005b271d-311b-38c9-b672-151bc69eb284",
                                                "text": "I have no memory of that event."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7122cdd-eaff-4ab2-8da0-4db930734ff1",
                                                "sense_id": "005b271d-311b-38c9-b672-151bc69eb284",
                                                "text": "My wedding is one of my happiest memories."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ce55442-4cf2-4fb9-b6bd-6cca473333b8",
                                                "sense_id": "005b271d-311b-38c9-b672-151bc69eb284",
                                                "text": "Sam and his friends will never forget the happy memories of the field trip to France."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a37fc20-f53f-3a4b-93e6-bc128a6c1e30",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9c9c0-c7fa-37d0-9793-d9f92a7c0954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of a computer that stores variable executable code or data (RAM) or unalterable executable code or default data (ROM)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ac62812-2b0c-40d3-8460-ad7a5fcef17d",
                                                "sense_id": "8a37fc20-f53f-3a4b-93e6-bc128a6c1e30",
                                                "text": "This data passes from the CPU to the memory."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5113819c-deef-44c5-91dc-b822475c8fd9",
                                                "sense_id": "8a37fc20-f53f-3a4b-93e6-bc128a6c1e30",
                                                "text": "My first microcomputer had 12K of memory. When I expanded to a full 64K, I thought I had all the memory I'd ever need. Hah. I know better now."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c06edef4-f437-3e34-9d1c-be081226bca4",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9c9c0-c7fa-37d0-9793-d9f92a7c0954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The time within which past events can be or are remembered."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37dba819-184b-4cf6-9ebb-63072f3ef8df",
                                                "sense_id": "c06edef4-f437-3e34-9d1c-be081226bca4",
                                                "text": "in recent memory"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d085bb51-4ec4-4351-8ff4-68e4176dcabb",
                                                "sense_id": "c06edef4-f437-3e34-9d1c-be081226bca4",
                                                "text": "in living memory"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aca7cec6-2a94-3faf-adb1-cf3715104846",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9c9c0-c7fa-37d0-9793-d9f92a7c0954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Which returns to its original shape when heated"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dde4f5f5-f00c-4d68-8972-dd4188223469",
                                                "sense_id": "aca7cec6-2a94-3faf-adb1-cf3715104846",
                                                "text": "memory metal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "feab7d5a-6edc-4763-ac05-c30d1396730a",
                                                "sense_id": "aca7cec6-2a94-3faf-adb1-cf3715104846",
                                                "text": "memory plastic"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71c19b8d-c20f-3813-86a1-5fb07a3e4b72",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9c9c0-c7fa-37d0-9793-d9f92a7c0954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A memorial."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d12eb968-71ee-42e9-8d80-6e6fc17cfa23",
                                                "sense_id": "71c19b8d-c20f-3813-86a1-5fb07a3e4b72",
                                                "text": "These weeds are memories of those worser hours."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2596ad09-ab34-3b56-b927-438568c3cde2",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9c9c0-c7fa-37d0-9793-d9f92a7c0954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of pelmanism (“memory card game”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dbec374-088f-4c8c-ad26-38a110faabef",
                                                "sense_id": "2596ad09-ab34-3b56-b927-438568c3cde2",
                                                "text": "After he saw her a few more times, Mr. Cherkasky asked Ms. Cochrane out on a date in May 2008 to Central Park. He brought along some games to break the ice, and Ms. Cochrane brought cupcakes. They found a quiet place to sit and played Memory and Yahtzee, both of which were new to Ms. Cochrane."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e33bcb7-bd50-4103-a07b-ce51be8ad08b",
                                                "sense_id": "2596ad09-ab34-3b56-b927-438568c3cde2",
                                                "text": "One example of that would be a memory game that I originally worked on with a friend of mine at Ovrflo Media some time ago. If you aren't familiar with the game of memory, it's a matching game where you are presented with several cards in the facedown position."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3e9d274-b45a-30a4-9ca2-1820940de6b1",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9c9c0-c7fa-37d0-9793-d9f92a7c0954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A term of venery for a social group of elephants, normally called a herd."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "collective",
                                            "countable",
                                            "rare",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
